   1 game            65.1%  (n=510)                       1.8+
   2 games           72.3%  (n=307)                       2.2+
   3 games           76.7%  (n=206)                       2.3+
   4 games           77.6%  (n=143)                       2.2+
   6 games           87.9%  (n=66)                       2.3+
   8 games           93.8%  (n=32)                       1.5+
  by position: share of one-game-so-far absences that continue | average total length
   QB: n= 168  misses the next game too 69.9%   avg length 3.0 games   1 game 40% / 2-3 30% / 4+ 30%
   RB: n= 158  misses the next game too 68.3%   avg length 2.6 games   1 game 46% / 2-3 32% / 4+ 23%
   WR: n= 228  misses the next game too 60.2%   avg length 2.7 games   1 game 48% / 2-3 28% / 4+ 24%
   TE: n=  51  misses the next game too 62.2%   avg length 2.8 games   1 game 45% / 2-3 22% / 4+ 33%
  all: 1 game 45%, 2 18%, 3 11%, 4-6 17%, 7+ 10%; median 2, mean 2.8

